        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions LOG100SLVSBR, 1 Inch Wood Door Pull with Brass Sleeves and Mounts</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 1 Inch Laguna Wood Door Pull with Solid Brass Mounts and Sleeves can be made in your choice of <a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-tcmbw.pdf?v=1704262320\"><b>wood</b></a></li>. Choose from favorites such as teak for it's durability outside or mahogany for its naturally deep color. This wooden door pull with end caps has a 1 inch solid wood grip making it dainty but not fragile. The 1 Inch Wood Door Pull has solid brass end caps and mounts that can be finished in a huge selection of finish colors. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n\r\nDon't see the right Wood Finish Color?  Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> and we can make it for you!\r\n<br>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/1-1-2-inch-logan-wood-door-pull-with-solid-brass-mounts-and-sleeves-first-impressions-log150slvsbr\"><b>1-1/2 Inch Wood Door Pull with Solid Brass Mounts and Sleeves</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the First Impressions LOG100SLVSBR Laguna Wooden Door Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Material: Solid Wood</li>\r\n<li>Pull Bracket Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull End Cap Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-Wood-tcmbw.pdf?v=1704262320\"><b>First Impressions Wood Color Guide (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/FII-LGN05-specifications.pdf?v=1704262338\"><b>First Impressions LOG100SLVSBR Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 3 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>LOG100012SLVSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 7\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Sleeve Length: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LOG100024SLVSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Sleeve Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>LOG100036SLVSBR:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Mount: 27\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Sleeve Length: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNote: This wood door handle is handmade in the USA when you order it—allowing it to be custom designed to fit your specific door application, including <b>Different Wood Types</b> and <b>Other Lengths</b>. Unfortunately, because of the made-to-order nature of the door handle, it is <b>Not Cancelable or Returnable.</b> Please <a href=\"/pages/contact\">Contact Us</a> with your requirements or if you have any questions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Wooden Door Pull with End Caps | 1 Inch Wood Door Pull",
                "description": "The 1 Inch Laguna Wood Door Pull with Solid Brass Mounts and Sleeves can be made in your choice of wood. Choose from favorites such as teak for it's durability outside or mahogany for its naturally deep color. This wooden door pull with end caps has a 1 inch solid wood grip making it dainty but not fragile. The 1 Inch Wood Door Pull has solid brass end caps and mounts that can be finished in a huge selection of finish colors. Choose from 12 inch, 24 inch, or 36 inch lengths.",
                "keywords": "1 Inch Diameter Wooden Pull with End Caps, 1 Inch Laguna Wood Door Pull with Solid Brass Mounts and Sleeves, First Impressions LGN05, Wooden Door Pulls with End Caps, 1 Inch Wood Door Pulls, First Impressions Laguna Collection Series 5 Door Pulls, wooden door handles, wooden door pulls with brass mounts, First Impressions LGN05 Laguna Wooden Door Handles, FII-LGN05, FII-LOG100SLVSBR, First Impressions LOG100SLVSBR, First Impressions logan100 door pulls,"
